CFG_BLE_PRIVACY_ENABLED|CFG_BLE_PRIVACY_ENABLED|Application configuration - Application parameters||||Privacy option
ADV_INTERVAL_MIN|ADV_INTERVAL_MIN|Application configuration - Application parameters||20|10240|Shall be &gt 20ms and &lt 10240ms
ADV_INTERVAL_MIN_HEXA|ADV_INTERVAL_MIN_HEXA|Application configuration - Application parameters||0x0020|0x4000|Shall be &lt 80ms
ADV_INTERVAL_MAX|ADV_INTERVAL_MAX|Application configuration - Application parameters||20|10240|Shall be &gt 20ms and &lt 10240ms
ADV_INTERVAL_MAX_HEXA|ADV_INTERVAL_MAX_HEXA|Application configuration - Application parameters||0x0020|0x4000|Shall be &lt 100ms
ADV_LP_INTERVAL_MIN|ADV_LP_INTERVAL_MIN|Application configuration - Application parameters||0||Shall be &gt 20ms and &lt 10240ms
ADV_LP_INTERVAL_MIN_HEXA|ADV_LP_INTERVAL_MIN_HEXA|Application configuration - Application parameters||||Shall be &lt 80ms
ADV_LP_INTERVAL_MAX|ADV_LP_INTERVAL_MAX|Application configuration - Application parameters||0||Shall be &gt 20ms and &lt 10240ms
ADV_LP_INTERVAL_MAX_HEXA|ADV_LP_INTERVAL_MAX_HEXA|Application configuration - Application parameters||||Shall be &lt 100ms
ADV_TYPE|ADV_TYPE|Application configuration - Application parameters||||List of advertising types, can be: - Undirected scannable and connectable(ADV_IND 0x00) - Directed non scannable(ADV_DIRECT_IND 0x01) - Scannable but non connectable(ADV_SCAN_IND 0x02) - Non connectable and no scan response (ADV_NONCONN_IND 0x03) - Scan response(SCAN_RSP 0x03)
ADV_FILTER|ADV_FILTER|Application configuration - Application parameters||||Advertising policy for filtering (white list related), can be: - Process scan and connection requests from all devices, i.e. the White List is not in use.(NO_WHITE_LIST_USE 0x00) - Process connection requests from all devices and only scan requests from devices that are in the White List.(WHITE_LIST_FOR_ONLY_SCAN 0x01) - Process scan requests from all devices and only connection requests from devices that are in the White List (WHITE_LIST_FOR_ONLY_CONN 0x02) - Process scan and connection requests only from devices in the White List.(WHITE_LIST_FOR_ALL 0x03)
