SERVICE0_UUID_128_INPUT_TYPE|UUID 128 input type|Service||||Service UUID input type, full or reduced
SERVICE0_UUID_ALLOCATION_TYPE|UUID allocation type|Service||||Type of service UUID, 0x01 = 16 bits UUID, 0x02 = 128 bits UUID
SERVICE0_UUID|UUID|Service||||Contains the UUID (only 2 bytes are defined by the user for 16 or 128 bits UUID)
SERVICE0_LONG_NAME|Service long name|Service||||Default value for this SIG Characteristic is: ImmediateAlert
SERVICE0_SHORT_NAME|Service short name|Service||||Default value for this SIG Characteristic is: IAS
SERVICE0_TYPE|Type|Service||||Type of service, either Primary or Secondary
SERVICE0_MAX_ATTRIBUTES_RECORDS|Service max attributes record(s)|Service||||Value depends of the number of characteristics (nbOfChar) with the property Notify or Indicate(nbOfDescriptor) Max_Attributes_Records = 1 + 2*nbOfChar + nbOfDescriptor
SERVICE0_NUMBER_OF_CHARACTERISTICS|Number of characteristics|Service||0|25|Number of services; maximum is 25
SERVICE0_CHAR0|Characteristic|Characteristic0||||characteristic number
SERVICE0_CHAR0_UUID_TYPE|UUID type|Characteristic0||||Type of characteristic UUID, 0x01 = 16 bits UUID, 0x02 = 128 bits UUID
SERVICE0_CHAR0_UUID_ALLOCATION_TYPE|UUID allocation type|Characteristic0||||Type of service UUID, 0x01 = 16 bits UUID, 0x02 = 128 bits UUID
SERVICE0_CHAR0_UUID_128_INPUT_TYPE|UUID 128 input type|Characteristic0||||Characteristic UUID input type, full or reduced
SERVICE0_CHAR0_UUID|UUID|Characteristic0||||Contains the UUID (only 2 bytes are defined by the user for 16 or 128 bits UUID)
SERVICE0_CHAR0_CHARACTERISTIC_TYPE|Characteristic type|Characteristic0||||Type of characteristic Non-buffered or Buffered
SERVICE0_CHAR0_LONG_NAME|Characteristic long name|Characteristic0||||Default value for this SIG Characteristic is: AerobicHeartRateLowerLimit
SERVICE0_CHAR0_SHORT_NAME|Characteristic short name|Characteristic0||||Default value for this SIG Characteristic is: AHRLL
SERVICE0_CHAR0_VALUE_LENGTH|Value length|Characteristic0||1|1024|Number of bytes to be written or to notify (1 to 512). Default value for this SIG Characteristic is: 1
SERVICE0_CHAR0_LENGTH_CHARACTERISTIC|Lenght characteristic|Characteristic0||||Type of characteristic length in ble_defs.h. can be either CHAR_VALUE_LEN_CONSTANT(0x00) or CHAR_VALUE_LEN_VARIABLE(0x01). Default value for this SIG Characteristic is Constant.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_ENCRY_KEY_SIZE|Encryption Key Size|Characteristic0||0x07|0x10|
SERVICE0_CHAR0_PROP_BROADCAST|CHAR_PROP_BROADCAST|Characteristic0||||Broadcasting of the characteristic value using a characteristic configuration descriptor. Default value is No.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_PROP_READ|CHAR_PROP_READ|Characteristic0||||Reading of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_PROP_WRITE_NO_RESP|CHAR_PROP_WRITE_NO_RESP|Characteristic0||||Writing Without Response of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_PROP_WRITE|CHAR_PROP_WRITE|Characteristic0||||Write of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_PROP_NOTIFY|CHAR_PROP_NOTIFY|Characteristic0||||Notify of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_PROP_INDICATE|CHAR_PROP_INDICATE|Characteristic0||||Indicate of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_VALUE_OFFSET|Update char value offset|Characteristic0||0|=(SERVICE0_CHAR0_VALUE_LENGTH-1)|The offset from which the attribute value has to be updated. Only active when CHAR_PROP_NOTIFY or CHAR_PROP_INDICATE is selected. Used in custom_stm.c aci_gatt_update_char_value function
SERVICE0_CHAR0_ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHEN_READ|ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHEN_READ|Characteristic0||||Authentication read of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHOR_READ|ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHOR_READ|Characteristic0||||Authorization read of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_ATTR_PERMISSION_ENCRY_READ|ATTR_PERMISSION_ENCRY_READ|Characteristic0||||Encryption read of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHEN_WRITE|ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHEN_WRITE|Characteristic0||||Authentication write of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHOR_WRITE|ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHOR_WRITE|Characteristic0||||Authorization write of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_ATTR_PERMISSION_ENCRY_WRITE|ATTR_PERMISSION_ENCRY_WRITE|Characteristic0||||Encryption write of the characteristic value. Default value for this SIG characteristic is Yes.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_GATT_NOTIFY_ATTRIBUTE_WRITE|GATT_NOTIFY_ATTRIBUTE_WRITE|Characteristic0||||The application will be notified when a client writes to this attribute. An ACI_GATT_ATTRIBUTE_MODIFIED_EVENT will be issued.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_GATT_NOTIFY_WRITE_REQ_AND_WAIT_FOR_APPL_RESP|GATT_NOTIFY_WRITE_REQ_AND_WAIT_FOR_APPL_RESP|Characteristic0||||The application will be notified when a write request, a write cmd or a signed write cmd is received by the server for this attribute. An ACI_GATT_WRITE_PERMIT_REQ_EVENT will be issued.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_GATT_NOTIFY_READ_REQ_AND_WAIT_FOR_APPL_RESP|GATT_NOTIFY_READ_REQ_AND_WAIT_FOR_APPL_RESP|Characteristic0||||The application will be notified when a read request of any type is received for this attribute. An ACI_GATT_READ_PERMIT_REQ_EVENT will be issued.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_GATT_NOTIFY_NOTIFICATION_COMPLETION|GATT_NOTIFY_NOTIFICATION_COMPLETION|Characteristic0||||The application will be notified when notifications are transmitted. An ACI_GATT_NOTIFICATION_COMPLETE_EVENT will be issued.
SERVICE0_CHAR0_NUMBER_OF_CHAR_DESCRIPTORS|Number of char descriptors|Characteristic0||0|10|Number of char descriptors

